\section{Error Propagation Model}
Let $\Delta_n$ denote numerical error at cycle $n$. Error propagation satisfies:
\begin{equation}
\Delta_{n+1} = \lambda \Delta_n + \eta_n,
\end{equation}
where:
\begin{itemize}
    \item $\lambda < 1$ is the contraction factor,
    \item $\eta_n$ is bounded entropy-induced perturbation.
\end{itemize}

Thus:
\begin{equation}
\sup_n \Delta_n < \frac{\sup_n \eta_n}{1 - \lambda}.
\end{equation}

